cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RecordBridge, please cite it as below."
title: "RecordBridge: A Student-Records Data Integrity & Governance Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A config-driven data-integrity pipeline that bulk-ingests messy student
  records, validates and de-duplicates them with a full audit trail, and reports
  data quality on a dashboard. Runs entirely on synthetic data with no PII.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Choksi"
    given-names: "Krishita Sanjay"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-01-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Krishita17/record-bridge"
keywords:
  - data governance
  - data quality
  - data engineering
  - entity resolution
  - record linkage
  - fuzzy matching
  - audit trail
  - synthetic data
